# Transcript-First Layout and Canonical Themes

Status: IN_PROGRESS
Milestone: M2-M4 Primary UX
Dependencies: 05_WINDOW_SHELL.todo, 19_LIVE_TRANSCRIPTION.todo, 21_BACKGROUND_TRANSLUCENCY.todo

## Purpose

Make transcription the primary view, keep notes collapsed by default, and offer the owner's two themes plus Plain.

## Tasks

- [x] Put the live transcript in the main growing reading area; start with Notes collapsed.
- [x] Preserve note text, unsaved status and explicit editing across collapse and mode changes.
- [x] Read canonical DeepSeaFoam/Harbor Daylight palettes without modifying their base.
- [x] Add sun/moon themed toggle, current name and separate Plain B/W reset.
- [x] Theme all normal/hover/pressed/selected/input/scrolling/status surfaces through semantic brushes.
- [x] Preserve background-only opacity, HWND/affinity, no-repeat-confirmation and native Python behavior.
- [x] Finish exact-package local layout/theme/cursor-policy regression evidence.
- [ ] Requalify captured pixels and pointer behavior in the actual sharing-product matrix.
- [ ] Record owner readability and native-device UX acceptance.

## Acceptance criteria

- [x] Default transcript occupies the primary view and notes expand/collapse without data loss.
- [x] Canonical colors and opaque text/selection/action contrast are covered by tests.
- [x] Theme/opacity/notes visibility changes do not recreate HWND or start/stop audio.
- [ ] Relevant remote capture/foreground and owner usability evidence is recorded.

## Completion evidence

- Core33tests include canonical palette/toggle/contrast cases.
- Local UI smoke covers default passive/collapsed state, themes/plain reset, stable HWND,
  note/transcript preservation, alpha, hit regions and prior file/close regressions.
- Passive output-device selection and both transcript/notes scrolling pass without keyboard-focus takeover.
- Read-only review found the default ListBox Focus requirement; explicit passive selection fixes it.
- Canonical source identity and palette hashes: docs\CURSOR-AND-THEMES.md.
- Exact package123245 UI regressions pass;484files/76167343bytes,
  SHA25675544D20F3C5CB70E9F8DF5E4B99AD4BBFA6E55AB61F52FE33274F80FED8F1EC.
- Existing user process remained running; no positive-control display, audio or live meeting capture was initiated.

